-- Cases: every FIR is replayed through the stored procedures ---------------
-- fir_id values follow the order of registration below (1 to 24).

-- ------------------------------------------------------------------
-- FIR 1: Cloth shop 14, Fruit Market Road, Riverside (2026-01-08)
